		summary = "**Gen Alpha slang** is the ever-changing vocabulary of kids born from the early 2010s onward, spread through [[YouTube]], [[TikTok]], [[Roblox]] and school hallways. Many words start as jokes in [[Internet meme|memes]] and end up in dictionaries.",
		sections = {
			{
				"Glossary",
				"[[Skibidi Toilet|Skibidi]] — anything, really. [[Rizz]] — charm. [[Sigma (slang)|Sigma]] — lone-wolf cool. [[Aura (slang)|Aura]] — vibe points. [[Fanum tax]] — food thievery. [[Mewing]] — jawline silence. [[No cap]] — no lie. [[Bussin]] — delicious. [[Sus]] — suspicious. [[Delulu]] — dreaming big. [[NPC (slang)|NPC]] — predictable. [[6-7 (meme)|6-7]] — nothing at all.",
			},
			{
				"Warning for grown-ups",
				"Adults who try to use these words correctly instantly lose 500 [[Aura (slang)|aura]].",
