		summary = "The **guanaco** is a [[Camelidae|camelid]] native to [[South America]], closely related to the domesticated [[Llama|llama]]. Guanacos are one of two wild South American camelids; the other species is the [[Vicuña|vicuña]], which lives at higher elevations.",
		infobox = {
			{ "Scientific name", "Lama guanicoe" },
