		aliases = { "Loons", "Divers" },
		summary = "**Loons** ([[North American English]]) or **divers** ([[British English|British]] / Irish English) are a group of aquatic [[Bird|birds]] found in much of [[North America]] and northern [[Eurasia]]. All living species of loons are members of the [[Genus|genus]] Gavia, [[Family (taxonomy)|family]] Gaviidae, and [[Order (taxonomy)|order]] Gaviiformes.",
