		tags = { "Mammals", "Rodents" },
		aliases = { "Marmots", "Marmota" },
		summary = "**Marmots** are large ground squirrels in the [[Genus|genus]] **Marmota**, with 15 species living in Asia, Europe, and North America. These [[Herbivore|herbivores]] are active during the summer, when they can often be found in groups, but are not seen during the winter, when they hibernate underground. They are the heaviest and largest members of the [[Squirrel|squirrel]] family.",
