		aliases = { "Old World vultures" },
		summary = "**Old World vultures** are vultures that are found in the [[Old World]], i.e. the continents of Europe, Asia and Africa, and which belong to the family Accipitridae, which also includes [[Eagle|eagles]], buzzards, kites, and hawks.",
