		description = "Capital city of Edo State, Nigeria",
		tags = { "Western Africa", "Nigeria" },
		summary = "**Benin City** is the capital and largest city of Edo State, southern Nigeria. It is the fourth-largest city in [[Nigeria]] according to the 2006 census, after [[Lagos]], [[Kano (city)|Kano]], and [[Ibadan]]. Benin City comprises three local government areas; Egor, Ikpoba-Okha and Oredo with some parts extending into the Ovia North-East and Uhunmwonde LGAs.",
