		summary = "**Cần Thơ** is the third largest centrally-governed city in [[Vietnam]] and is in the Mekong Delta region. It is noted for its floating markets, Bánh tráng-making village, and rural [[Canal|canals]]. Cần Thơ has a population of around 4,199,824 as of 2024.",
