		title = "Megalopolis",
		category = "City",
		fame = 3,
		emoji = "🏙️",
		source = "wikipedia",
		description = "Grouping of neighbouring metropolises",
		tags = { "Cities", "Urban studies and planning" },
		aliases = { "Supercity", "Megaregion" },
		summary = "A **megalopolis**, also called a **supercity** or **megaregion**, is a group of [[Metropolitan area|metropolitan areas]] which are perceived as a continuous urban area through common systems of transport, economy, resources, ecology, and so on. They are integrated enough that coordinating policy is valuable, although the constituent [[Metropolis|metropolises]] keep their individual identities. The megalopolis concept has become highly influential as it introduced a new, larger scale thinking about urban patterns and growth.",
