		sections = {
			{
				"Overview",
				"Sage Publishing has offices located across North America, Europe, and the Asia Pacific region. In [[North America]], Sage Publishing has offices in Los Angeles, Washington DC, and [[Toronto]]. The European operations are headquartered in [[London|London, United Kingdom]]. In the Asia Pacific region, Sage Publishing has established offices in Melbourne, Australia, [[India]] and [[Singapore]]. It publishes more than 1,000 journals, more than 800 books a year, reference works and electronic products covering business, humanities, social sciences, science, technology and medicine. Sage also owns and publishes under the imprints of Corwin Press (since 1990), CQ Press (since 2008), Learning Matters (since 2011), and Adam Matthew Digital (since 2012).",
