		summary = 'An **autonomous region** is a provincial-level administrative division and [[Provinces of China|province equivalent]] in China. An autonomous region has its own local government, but under the law of the People\'s Republic of China, an autonomous region has more legislative rights, such as the right to "formulate self-government regulations and other separate regulations." An autonomous region is the highest level of minority autonomous entity in China, which has a comparably higher population of a particular minority ethnic group.',
