		tags = { "More articles" },
		summary = "A **biological process** is a process necessary for an [[Organism|organism]] to live, and therefore shapes its capacity to interact with its environment. Biological processes are made of many [[Chemical reaction|chemical reactions]] or other events that are involved in the persistence and transformation of life forms.",
