		tags = { "More articles" },
		summary = "The **CRC Press** is a publishing imprint principally for technical books. Many of its books are related to [[Engineering|engineering]], [[Science|science]] and [[Mathematics|mathematics]]. Its scope also includes books on [[Business|business]], forensics and [[Information technology|information technology]]. In 2003 the imprint was acquired by Taylor & Francis, a subsidiary of Informa. The CRC Press and [[Routledge]] imprints are key components of Taylor & Francis's academic publishing. As of 2025, the branding of CRC Press presents it as part of the Routledge branding.",
