		fame = 2,
		emoji = "💭",
		source = "wikipedia",
		description = "Suppression of speech and information",
		tags = { "Mass media" },
		summary = '**Censorship** is the suppression of [[Speech|speech]], public communication, or other [[Information|information]]. This may be done on the basis that such material is considered objectionable, harmful, sensitive, or "inconvenient". Censorship can be conducted by [[Government|governments]] and private institutions. When an individual such as an author or other creator engages in censorship of their own works or speech, it is referred to as self-censorship. Specific rules and regulations regarding censorship vary between legal jurisdictions and/or private organizations.',
