		summary = "In [[Physics|physics]], **dynamics** or **classical dynamics** is the study of forces and their effect on [[Motion|motion]]. It is a branch of [[Classical mechanics|classical mechanics]], along with statics and [[Kinematics|kinematics]]. The fundamental principle of dynamics is linked to Newton's second law.",
