		tags = { "Business and economics" },
		aliases = { "Electronic commerce" },
		summary = "**E-commerce** (**electronic commerce**) refers to [[Commerce|commercial activities]] including the electronic buying or selling [[Goods and services|products and services]] which are conducted on online platforms or over the [[Internet]]. E-commerce draws on technologies such as mobile commerce, electronic funds transfer, supply chain management, Internet marketing, online transaction processing, electronic data interchange (EDI), inventory management systems, and automated data collection systems. E-commerce is a part of [[Retail|retail]]. It is the largest segment of the [[Electronics industry|electronics industry]] and is in turn driven by the technological advances of the semiconductor industry.",
