		aliases = { "Elliott Cresson Gold Medal" },
		summary = 'The **Elliott Cresson Medal**, also known as the **Elliott Cresson Gold Medal**, was the highest award given by the Franklin Institute. The award was established by Elliott Cresson, life member of the Franklin Institute, with $1,000 granted in 1848. The endowed award was to be "for a discovery in the Arts and Sciences, or for the invention or improvement of some useful machine, or for a new process or combination of materials in manufactures, or for ingenuity skill or perfection in workmanship." The medal was first awarded in 1875, 21 years after Cresson\'s death.',
