				"Overview",
				"Different from celebrity-focused publications such as Us Weekly, People, and In Touch Weekly, EW primarily concentrates on entertainment media news and critical reviews; unlike [[Variety (magazine)|Variety]] and [[The Hollywood Reporter]], which were primarily established as trade magazines aimed at industry insiders, EW targets a more general audience.",
