		summary = "The **Gold Medal of the Royal Astronomical Society** is the highest award given by the Royal Astronomical Society (RAS). It usually recognises lifetime achievement in the fields supported by the RAS, but has occasionally been given for an individual discovery.",
		sections = {
			{
				"Overview",
