		summary = "Health care is delivered by health professionals and allied health fields. [[Medicine]], dentistry, pharmacy, midwifery, nursing, optometry, audiology, [[Psychology|psychology]], occupational therapy, physical therapy, athletic training, and other health professions all constitute health care. The term includes work done in providing primary care, secondary care, tertiary care, mental health care and [[Public health|public health]].",
