		tags = { "More articles" },
		summary = "**Independence** is a condition of a [[Nation|nation]], [[Country|country]], or [[Sovereign state|state]], in which residents and population, or some portion thereof, exercise self-government, and usually [[Sovereignty|sovereignty]], over its territory. The opposite of independence is the status of a [[Dependent territory|dependent territory]] or [[Colony|colony]]. The commemoration of the independence day of a country or nation celebrates when a country is free from all forms of [[Colonialism|colonialism]]; free to build a country or nation without any interference from other nations.",
	},
	{
		title = "Independence of Brazil",
