		aliases = { "Brood", "Progeny" },
		summary = "Collective offspring may be known as a **brood** or **progeny**. This can refer to a set of simultaneous offspring, such as the chicks hatched from one clutch of eggs, or to all offspring produced over time, as with the honeybee. Offspring can occur after [[Mating|mating]], artificial insemination, or as a result of [[Cloning|cloning]].",
		sections = {
			{
				"Overview",
				"Human offspring (descendants) are referred to as [[Child|children]]; male children are sons and female children are daughters (see [[Kinship]]).",
