			{ "Spoken in", "Latium, later the [[Roman Kingdom]] and [[Roman Republic|Republic]]" },
			{ "Writing system", "Old Italic script before it evolved into the [[Latin alphabet]]" },
			{ "Era", "Attested since 7th century BC. Developed into [[Classical Latin]] around 75 BC." },
		},
