		summary = "The **Pew Research Center** (also simply known as **Pew**) is a nonpartisan American think tank based in [[Washington, D.C.]] It provides information on social issues, [[Public opinion|public opinion]], and demographic trends shaping the United States and the world. It also conducts public opinion polling, demographic research, random sample survey research, and panel based surveys, media content analysis, and other empirical [[Social science|social science]] research.",
