		tags = { "More articles" },
		summary = "A **protagonist** is the main [[Character (arts)|character]] of a story. The protagonist makes key decisions that affect the plot, primarily influencing the story and propelling it forward, and is often the character who faces the most significant obstacles and choices. If a story contains a subplot, or is a narrative made up of several stories, then each subplot may have its own protagonist.",
		sections = {
			{
				"Overview",
