		summary = '**Recreation** is an activity of [[Leisure|leisure]], often done for [[Happiness|enjoyment]], amusement, or [[Pleasure|pleasure]] and are considered to be "fun". The "need to do something for recreation" is an essential element of human biology and [[Psychology|psychology]].',
