		tags = { "Law", "Basics" },
		summary = "**Rights** are [[Law|legal]], social, or [[Ethics|ethical]] [[Principle|principles]] of [[Freedom|freedom]] or entitlement; that is, rights are the fundamental normative rules about what is allowed of people or owed to people according to some legal system, social convention, or ethical theory. Rights are an important concept in [[Law|law]] and [[Ethics|ethics]], especially theories of [[Justice|justice]] and [[Deontology|deontology]].",
		sections = {
			{
				"Overview",
