		tags = { "More articles" },
		aliases = { "THR" },
		summary = "**The Hollywood Reporter** (**THR**) is an American digital and print magazine which focuses on the [[Cinema of the United States|film]], television, theatre, and entertainment industries. It was founded in 1930 as a daily trade paper, and in 2010 switched to a weekly large-format print magazine with a revamped website. As of 2020, the day-to-day operations of the company are handled by Penske Media Corporation through a joint venture with Eldridge Industries.",
