		fame = 1,
		emoji = "⚖️",
		source = "wikipedia",
		description = "Metric unit of mass equivalent to 1,000 kilograms or 1 megagram",
		tags = { "More articles" },
		summary = "The **tonne** ( or; symbol: **t**) is a unit of mass equal to 1,000 [[Kilogram|kilograms]]. It is also referred to as a **metric ton** in the United States to distinguish it from the non-metric units of the short ton and the long ton. One tonne is equivalent to approximately 2,204.6 pounds, 1.102 short tons, and 0.984 long tons. The exact corresponding SI unit is the **megagram** (symbol **Mg**), a less common way to express the same mass.",
	},
