		tags = { "More articles" },
		aliases = { "Sovereign, Tsar and Grand Prince of all Russia" },
		summary = "The **Tsar of all Russia**, formally the **Sovereign, Tsar and Grand Prince of all Russia**, was the title of the Russian monarch from 1547 to 1721. During this period, the state was a [[Tsardom of Russia|tsardom]].",
		sections = {
			{
				"Overview",
