		aliases = { "URA" },
		summary = "The **Universities Research Association** (**URA**) is a non-profit association of more than 90 research universities, primarily but not exclusively in the United States. It has members also in Japan, Italy, and the United Kingdom. It was founded in 1965 at the behest of the President's Science Advisory Committee and the [[National Academy of Sciences]] to build and operate Fermilab, a National Accelerator Laboratory.",
