		tags = { "More articles" },
		summary = "**Uzbeks** are a [[Turkic peoples|Turkic]] ethnic group native to [[Central Asia]], and the largest Turkic ethnic group in the region. They comprise the majority [[Population (human biology)|population]] of [[Uzbekistan]], alongside minorities of Tajiks and Karakalpaks, and also form minority groups in [[Afghanistan]], [[Tajikistan]], [[Kyrgyzstan]], [[Pakistan]], [[Kazakhstan]], [[Turkmenistan]], [[Russia]], and [[China]]. Uzbek diaspora communities also exist in Turkey, [[Saudi Arabia]], the United States, [[Ukraine]], and other countries.",
