		description = "Highest prize awarded at the Cannes Film Festival",
		tags = { "More articles" },
		summary = "The is the highest prize awarded to the director of the Best Feature Film of the Official Competition at the [[Cannes Film Festival]]. It was introduced in 1955 by the festival's organizing committee. Previously, from 1939 to 1954, the festival's highest prize was the **Grand Prix du Festival International du Film**. In 1964, the was replaced again by the Grand Prix, before being reintroduced in 1975.",
