		aliases = { "Gulf of Biscay", "Gulf of Gascony" },
		summary = "The **Bay of Biscay**, also known as the **Gulf of Biscay** or the **Gulf of Gascony**, is a [[Bay|gulf]] of the northeast [[Atlantic Ocean]] located south of the [[Celtic Sea]]. It lies along the northern coast of [[Spain]], extending westward from the [[France|French]] border to Cape Ortegal, and along the western coast of [[France]] from Point Penmarc'h southward to the [[Spain|Spanish]] border.",
