		aliases = { "The East", "The Orient" },
		summary = "The **Eastern world**, also known as **the East** or historically **the Orient**, is an umbrella term for various [[Culture|cultures]] or [[Society|social structures]], nations and [[Philosophy|philosophical systems]], which vary depending on the context. It most often includes [[Asia]], the [[Mediterranean basin|Mediterranean region]] and the [[Arab world]], specifically in historical ([[Post-classical history|pre-modern]]) contexts, and in modern times in the context of [[Orientalism]]. The Eastern world is often seen as a counterpart to the [[Western world]].",
