		fame = 2,
		emoji = "🏞️",
		source = "wikipedia",
		description = "African river delta bordering the Mediterranean",
		tags = { "More articles" },
		summary = "The **Nile Delta** is the [[River delta|delta]] formed in Lower Egypt where the [[Nile]] River spreads out and drains into the [[Mediterranean Sea]]. It is one of the world's largest deltas. From [[Alexandria]] in the west to Port Said in the east; it covers 240 km of the Mediterranean coastline and is a rich [[Agriculture|agricultural]] region. From north to south the delta is about 160 km long. The Delta begins from [[Cairo]].",
