		tags = { "More articles" },
		aliases = { "Peloponnesus", "Morea" },
		summary = "The **Peloponnese**, **Peloponnesus**, or **Morea**, is a [[Peninsula|peninsula]] and geographic region in southern [[Greece]], and the southernmost region of the [[Balkans]]. It is connected to the central part of the country by the Isthmus of Corinth land bridge, which separates the Gulf of Corinth from the Saronic Gulf. From the late [[Middle Ages]] until the 19th century, the peninsula was known as the Morea, a name still in colloquial use in its demotic form.",
