		tags = { "More articles" },
		summary = "**Physical fitness** is a state of [[Health|health]] and [[Well-being|well-being]] and, more specifically, the ability to perform aspects of sports, occupations, and daily activities. Physical fitness is generally achieved through proper [[Nutrition|nutrition]], moderate-vigorous physical exercise, and sufficient rest along with a formal recovery plan.",
		sections = {
			{
				"Overview",
				"Before the [[Industrial Revolution]], fitness was defined as the capacity to carry out the day's activities without undue fatigue or lethargy.",
