		summary = "The **Southern Alps** is a [[Mountain range|mountain range]] extending along much of the length of [[New Zealand]]'s [[South Island]], reaching its greatest elevations near the range's western side. The name \"Southern Alps\" generally refers to the entire range, although separate names are given to many of the smaller ranges that form part of it.",
