		summary = "The **Tian Shan**, also known as the **Tengri Tagh** or **Tengir-Too**, is a large system of [[Mountain range|mountain ranges]] in [[Central Asia]]. The highest peak is Jengish Chokusu at 7439 m high and located in Kyrgyzstan. Its lowest point is at the Turpan Depression, which is 154 m below sea level.",
		sections = {
