		summary = "A **vassal state** is any [[State (polity)|state]] that has varying degrees of influence, but is obligated to a superior state or empire. Vassal states were seen among the empires of the [[Near East]], dating back to the era of the [[Ancient Egypt|Egyptian]], [[Hittites|Hittite]], Caananite and [[Mitanni]] conflict, as well as in [[History of China|ancient China]].",
