		tags = { "More articles" },
		summary = "The **West Indies** are an island [[Subregion|subregion]] of the [[Americas]], surrounded by the [[Atlantic Ocean|North Atlantic Ocean]] and the [[Caribbean Sea]], which comprises 13 independent [[Island country|island countries]] and 18 [[Dependent territory|dependencies]] in three [[Archipelago|archipelagos]]: the [[Greater Antilles]], the [[Lesser Antilles]], and the Lucayan Archipelago.",
