		description = "Geographical and cultural region in China",
		tags = { "More articles" },
		summary = "**Western China** ( or ) is the west of [[China]]. It consists of [[Southwestern China]] and Northwestern China. In the definition of the Chinese government, Western China covers six [[Provinces of China|provinces]] ([[Sichuan]], Guizhou, [[Yunnan]], Shaanxi, [[Gansu]], and [[Qinghai]]), three [[Autonomous regions of China|autonomous regions]] ([[Tibet Autonomous Region|Tibet]], Ningxia, and [[Xinjiang]]), and one [[Direct-administered municipality|direct-administered municipality]] ([[Chongqing]]).",
