		summary = "The **Early Cretaceous** ([[Geochronology|geochronological]] name) or the **Lower Cretaceous** (chronostratigraphic name) is the earlier or lower of the two major divisions of the [[Cretaceous]]. It is usually considered to stretch from 143.1 Ma to 100.5 Ma.",
