		summary = "The **Hausa Kingdoms**, also known as **Hausaland**, were a collection of states ruled by the [[Hausa people]], before the Fulani jihads. They were situated between the [[Niger River]] and [[Lake Chad]] (modern day northern [[Nigeria]]). Hausaland lay between the Western Sudanic empires of [[Ghana Empire|Ancient Ghana]], [[Mali Empire|Mali]] and [[Songhai Empire|Songhai]] and the Eastern Sudanic empire of [[Kanem–Bornu Empire|Kanem-Bornu]].",
