		tags = { "More articles" },
		aliases = { "Upper Jurassic" },
		summary = "The **Late Jurassic** is the third epoch of the [[Jurassic]] period, and it spans the [[Geologic time scale|geologic time]] from 161.5 ± 1.0 to 143.1 ± 0.6 [[Million years ago|million years ago]] (Ma), which is preserved in **Upper Jurassic** [[Stratum|strata]].",
