		summary = "**Makuria** was a [[Middle Ages|medieval]] Nubian [[Monarchy|kingdom]] in what is today northern [[Sudan]] and southern [[Egypt]]. Its capital was Dongola (Old Nubian:, Touggoul) in the fertile Dongola Reach, about halfway between the 3rd and 4th Nile cataract.",
