		aliases = { "Mwenemutapa", "Munhumutapa" },
		summary = "The **Mutapa Empire** – also referred to as **Mwenemutapa** or **Munhumutapa** – was a Shona empire in the north of the Zimbabwean Plateau.",
		sections = {
			{
				"Overview",
				'The [[Portuguese language|Portuguese]] term Monomotapa is a transliteration of the Shona royal title Mwenemutapa derived from a combination of two words, Mwene meaning "Lord" and Mutapa meaning "conquered land". Over time the monarch\'s royal title was applied to the kingdom as a whole, and used to denote the kingdom\'s territory on maps from the period.',
