		source = "wikipedia",
		description = "Flag of a country or nation",
		tags = { "Auxiliary historical sciences" },
		summary = "A **national flag** is a [[Flag|flag]] that represents and symbolizes a given [[Nation|nation]]. It is flown by the [[Government|government]] of that nation, but can also be flown by its citizens. A national flag is typically designed with specific meanings for its colors and symbols, which may also be used separately from the flag as a symbol of the nation. The design of a national flag is sometimes altered after the occurrence of important historical events.",
