		summary = 'The **Uyghur Khaganate**, [[Endonym and exonym|self defined]] as the **Toquz Oghuz** ("Nine Tribes") and known to the [[Tang dynasty|Tang Chinese]] as the **Jiuxing** was a [[Turkic peoples|Turkic]] empire that existed for about a century between the mid 8th and 9th centuries. It was a tribal confederation under the Uyghur nobility.',
