		description = "Tool used to cut through wood or other materials",
		tags = { "Tools", "Hand tools" },
		summary = "A **saw** is a [[Tool|tool]] consisting of a tough blade, wire, or [[Chainsaw|chain]] with a hard toothed edge used to cut through [[Material|material]]. Various terms are used to describe toothed and abrasive saws.",
		sections = {
			{
				"Overview",
				"Saws began as serrated materials, and when mankind learned how to use iron, it became the preferred material for saw blades of all kinds. There are numerous types of hand saws and mechanical saws, and different types of blades and cuts.",
