		summary = "In music, an **aria** (,;:,; arias in common usage; diminutive form: **arietta**,;: **ariette**; in English simply **air**) is a self-contained piece for one voice, with or without instrumental or [[Orchestra|orchestral]] [[Accompaniment|accompaniment]], normally part of a larger work.",
