		summary = "A **chord** is the simultaneous sound of two or more [[Musical note|musical notes]]. The most common chord has three notes and is known as a triad. Added tone chords, extended chords, and tone clusters can have more than three notes and are common in [[Contemporary classical music|contemporary classical music]] and [[Jazz|jazz]].",
		sections = {
			{
				"Overview",
