		tags = { "Household items", "Cooking and eating" },
		summary = "In [[Cutlery|cutlery]] or kitchenware, a **fork** (from 'pitchfork') is a utensil, now usually made of metal, whose long handle terminates in a head that branches into several narrow and often slightly curved tines with which one can spear foods either to hold them to cut with a knife or to lift them to the mouth.",
