		summary = "The **Association of American Universities** (**AAU**) is an organization of predominantly American [[Research university|research universities]] devoted to maintaining a strong system of academic [[Research|research]] and education. Founded in 1900, it consists of 69 [[Public university|public]] and [[Private university|private]] universities in the [[United States]] as well as 2 universities in [[Canada]]. AAU membership is by invitation only and requires an affirmative vote of three-quarters of current members.",
