		tags = { "More articles" },
		summary = "The **University of Chicago Press** is the university press of the [[University of Chicago]], a [[Private university|private]] [[Research university|research university]] in [[Chicago]], Illinois. It is the largest and one of the oldest university presses in North America. It publishes a wide range of academic titles, including The Chicago Manual of Style, numerous academic journals, and advanced monographs in the academic fields. The press is located just south of the Midway Plaisance on the University of Chicago campus.",
