			{ "Died", "23 August 634 (22 Jumada II 13 AH)" },
			{ "Occupation", "Businessman, public administrator, economist" },
		},
	},
	{
		title = "Abu Bakr al-Razi",
		category = "Person",
		fame = 3,
		emoji = "👤",
		source = "wikipedia",
		description = "10th-century Iranian physician and polymath",
		tags = { "Pre-modern figures", "Post-classical history" },
		aliases = { "Rhazes" },
		summary = '**Abū Bakr al-Rāzī**, also known as **Rhazes** (full name: ), 864 or 865 – 925 or 935 CE, was a Persian physician, philosopher and alchemist who lived during the [[Islamic Golden Age]]. He is widely regarded as one of the most important figures in the history of medicine, and also wrote on [[Logic|logic]], [[Astronomy|astronomy]] and [[Grammar|grammar]]. He is also known for his criticism of religion, especially with regard to the concepts of prophethood and revelation. However, the religio-philosophical aspects of his thought, which also included a belief in five "eternal principles", are fragmentary and only reported by authors who were often hostile to him.',
		sections = {
			{
				"Overview",
				"A comprehensive thinker, al-Razi made fundamental and enduring contributions to various fields, which he recorded in over 200 manuscripts, and is particularly remembered for numerous advances in medicine through his [[Observation|observations]] and discoveries. An early proponent of experimental medicine, he became a successful doctor, and served as chief physician of [[Baghdad]] and Ray hospitals. As a teacher of [[Medicine|medicine]], he attracted students of all backgrounds and interests and was said to be compassionate and devoted to the service of his patients, whether rich or poor. Along with Thābit ibn Qurra (836–901), he was one of the first to clinically distinguish between smallpox and measles. Through translation, his medical works and ideas became known among [[Middle Ages|medieval European]] practitioners and profoundly influenced medical education in the Latin West.",
			},
		},
		related = { "Al-Biruni", "Aryabhata" },
		infobox = {
