		summary = "**Cesare Beccaria Bonesana, Marquis of Gualdrasco and Villareggio** was an Italian criminologist, [[Jurist|jurist]], philosopher, economist, and politician. Beccaria is considered the father of modern criminal law and the father of criminal justice.",
