		tags = { "Western painters and illustrators", "Modern era" },
		summary = "**Gerhard Richter** is a German visual artist. Richter has produced [[Abstract art|abstract]] as well as photorealistic paintings, photographs and glass pieces. He is widely regarded as one of the most important contemporary German artists and several of his works have set record prices at auction, with him being the most expensive living painter at one time.",
