		emoji = "👤",
		source = "wikipedia",
		description = "French novelist (1821–1880)",
		tags = { "Western Europe", "France" },
		summary = "**Gustave Flaubert** was a French novelist. He has been considered the leading exponent of [[Literary realism|literary realism]] in his country and abroad. He is known especially for his debut novel Madame Bovary (1857), his Correspondence, and his scrupulous devotion to his style and [[Aesthetics|aesthetics]]. The celebrated writer [[Guy de Maupassant]] was a protégé of Flaubert.",
