		category = "Person",
		fame = 2,
		emoji = "👤",
		source = "wikipedia",
		description = "Russian polymath (1711–1765)",
		tags = { "Physics", "Early modern" },
		summary = "Among his discoveries were the atmosphere of Venus, the law of [[Conservation of mass|conservation of mass]] in [[Chemical reaction|chemical reactions]], the theoretical prediction of Antarctica, and the idea of coaxial rotors. His spheres of science were [[Natural science|natural science]], chemistry, physics, [[Mineralogy|mineralogy]], history, art, [[Philology|philology]], optical devices and others. One of the founders of modern geology, Lomonosov was also a poet and influenced the formation of the modern [[Russian language|Russian literary language]].",
