		tags = { "Western painters and illustrators", "Modern era" },
		summary = '**Pierre-Auguste Renoir** was a leading French [[Impressionism|Impressionist]] artist. In his depiction of feminine beauty, Renoir has been described as "the final representative of a tradition which runs directly from [[Peter Paul Rubens|Rubens]] to [[Antoine Watteau|Watteau]]."',
