		tags = { "Physics", "Modern" },
		aliases = { "Robert Andrews Millikan" },
		summary = '**Robert Andrews Millikan** (March 22, 1868 – December 19, 1953) was an American experimental [[Physicist|physicist]] who received the [[Nobel Prize in Physics]] in 1923 "for his work on the [[Elementary charge|elementary charge]] of electricity and on the [[Photoelectric effect|photoelectric effect]]."',
