		tags = { "Western Europe", "France" },
		aliases = { "Étienne Mallarmé" },
		summary = "**Étienne Mallarmé**, known professionally as **Stéphane Mallarmé**, was a French poet and critic. He was a major French [[Symbolism (movement)|Symbolist]] poet, and his work anticipated and inspired several revolutionary artistic schools of the early 20th century, such as [[Cubism]], Futurism, [[Dada|Dadaism]], and [[Surrealism]].",
