		tags = { "Asia", "Eastern Asia" },
		summary = "**Yasunari Kawabata** was a Japanese [[Novelist|novelist]] and [[Short story|short story]] writer whose spare, lyrical, subtly-shaded prose works won him the 1968 Nobel Prize in Literature, the first Japanese author to receive the award. His works have enjoyed broad international appeal and are still widely read.",
