		tags = { "Eudicots", "Rosales" },
		summary = "The **blackberry** is an edible fruit produced by many [[Species|species]] in the genus Rubus in the [[Family (taxonomy)|family]] [[Rosaceae]], hybrids among these species within the subgenus Rubus, and hybrids between the subgenera Rubus and Idaeobatus. The taxonomy of blackberries has historically been confused because of [[Hybrid (biology)|hybridization]] and apomixis so that species have often been grouped together and called species aggregates.",
