		aliases = { "Chick pea", "Cicer arietinum" },
		summary = "The **chickpea** or **chick pea** (**Cicer arietinum**) is an annual [[Legume|legume]] of the family [[Fabaceae]], subfamily Faboideae, cultivated for its edible seeds. Its different types are variously known as **gram**, **Bengal gram**, **chana**, **garbanzo**, **garbanzo bean**, or **Egyptian pea**. It is one of the earliest cultivated legumes, the oldest archaeological evidence of which was found in [[Syria]].",
