		summary = "**Common chicory** (**Cichorium intybus**) is a somewhat woody, [[Perennial|perennial]] [[Herbaceous plant|herbaceous plant]] of the family [[Asteraceae]], usually with bright blue [[Flower|flowers]], rarely white or pink. Native to [[Europe]], [[North Africa]], and [[West Asia|western Asia]], it has been introduced to the Americas, [[Australia]], and [[South Africa]].",
