		summary = "**Chlorophyta** or **chlorophytes** is a major division of [[Green algae|green algae]], and is [[Sister group|sister taxon]] to the other major division [[Charophyta]] (a [[Paraphyly|paraphyletic]] group of predominantly [[Fresh water|freshwater]] green algae, which form the [[Monophyly|monophyletic]] [[Clade|clade]] Streptophyta after including all land plants) as well as the proposed [[Basal (phylogenetics)|basal]] clade Prasinodermophyta, together with whom they form the major primary algae clade Viridiplantae (Plantae sensu stricto).",
