		tags = { "Eudicots", "Brassicales" },
		aliases = { "Collard" },
		summary = '**Collard** is a group of loose-leafed [[Cultivar|cultivars]] of [[Brassica oleracea]] (the same species as many common [[Vegetable|vegetables]], including [[Cabbage|cabbage]] and [[Broccoli|broccoli]]). Part of the Acephala Group (or "[[Kale|kale]] group"), collard is also classified as the [[Variety (botany)|variety]] B. oleracea var. viridis.',
