		aliases = { "Sycamore fig", "Fig-mulberry", "Sycamore" },
		summary = "**Ficus sycomorus**, called the **sycamore fig** or the **fig-mulberry** (because the leaves resemble those of the mulberry), **sycamore**, or **sycomore**, is a fig species that has been cultivated since ancient times.",
