		tags = { "Eudicots", "Others" },
		summary = "**Gardenia** is a [[Genus|genus]] of [[Flowering plant|flowering plants]] in the coffee family, [[Rubiaceae]], native to the [[Tropics|tropical]] and [[Subtropics|subtropical]] regions of [[Africa]], [[Asia]], [[Madagascar]], Pacific Islands, and [[Australia]].",
