		tags = { "Eudicots", "Others" },
		summary = "A **grape** is a [[Fruit|fruit]], [[Berry (botany)|botanically a berry]], of the [[Deciduous|deciduous]] woody [[Vine|vines]] of the flowering plant genus Vitis. Grapes are a non-climacteric type of fruit, generally occurring in clusters.",
		sections = {
			{
				"Overview",
