		summary = "**Pleurotus ostreatus**, commonly known as the **oyster mushroom**, **grey oyster mushroom**, **oyster fungus**, **hiratake**, or **pearl oyster mushroom**, is a popular [[Edible mushroom|edible mushroom]] found in temperate and subtropical forests around the world.",
