		tags = { "Eudicots", "Rosales" },
		summary = "The **raspberry** is the edible [[Fruit|fruit]] of several plant [[Species|species]] in the [[Genus|genus]] Rubus of the [[Rosaceae|rose family]], most of which are in the subgenus Idaeobatus. The name also applies to these plants themselves. Raspberries are [[Perennial|perennial]] with [[Woody plant|woody stems]].",
		sections = {
			{
				"Overview",
				"World production of raspberries in 2023 was 940,979 tonnes, led by Russia with 23% of the total. Raspberries are cultivated across northern Europe and North America and are consumed in various ways, including as whole fruit and in [[Fruit preserves|preserves]], cakes, pastries, ice cream, and liqueurs.",
