		tags = { "More articles" },
		aliases = { "Root vegetables" },
		summary = "**Root vegetables** are underground plant parts eaten by humans and other animals as [[Food|food]]. In agricultural and culinary terminology, the term applies to true [[Root|roots]], such as taproots and root tubers, as well as non-roots such as [[Bulb|bulbs]], corms, [[Rhizome|rhizomes]], and stem tubers.",
