		tags = { "Eudicots", "Asterales" },
		aliases = { "Sow thistles", "Hare thistles", "Hare lettuces" },
		summary = "**Sonchus** is a genus of flowering plants in the tribe Cichorieae within the family [[Asteraceae]] and are commonly known as **sow thistles** (less commonly **hare thistles** or **hare lettuces**). Sowthistles are annual, biennial or perennial herbs, with or without rhizomes and a few are even woody (subgenus Dendrosonchus, restricted to the [[Canary Islands]] and [[Madeira]]).",
