		summary = "**Willows**, also called **sallows** and **osiers**, of the [[Genus|genus]] **Salix**, comprise around 350 species (plus numerous hybrids) of typically [[Deciduous|deciduous]] [[Tree|trees]] and [[Shrub|shrubs]]. They are primarily found on moist [[Soil|soils]] in cold and [[Temperate climate|temperate]] regions.",
		sections = {
			{
				"Overview",
