		summary = "**Euglenozoa** are a large group of [[Flagellate|flagellate]] Discoba. Euglenozoa are represented by four major groups, i.e., Kinetoplastea, Diplonemea, Euglenida, and Symbiontida. Euglenozoa are unicellular, mostly around 15–40 m in size, although some euglenids get up to 500 m long.",
