	{
		title = "Grassland",
		category = "Science",
		fame = 1,
		emoji = "🌾",
		source = "wikipedia",
		description = "Area with vegetation dominated by grasses",
		tags = { "Biomes", "Grasslands" },
		summary = "A **grassland** is an area (or [[Ecosystem|ecosystem]]) where the [[Vegetation|vegetation]] is [[Dominance (ecology)|dominated]] by [[Poaceae|grasses]]. [[Cyperaceae|Sedges]] and rushes can also be found along with some legumes such as clover and other [[Herbaceous plant|herbs]]. Grasslands occur naturally on all continents except [[Antarctica]] and are found in most [[Ecoregion|ecoregions]] of the Earth. Furthermore, grasslands are one of the largest [[Biome|biomes]] on Earth, covering 31–69% of the Earth's land area. There are different types of grasslands: natural grasslands, semi-natural grasslands, and agricultural grasslands.",
