		tags = { "Science basics" },
		aliases = { "Infosci" },
		summary = "**Information science** (abbreviated as **infosci**) is an academic field that is primarily concerned with the [[Analysis|analysis]], collection, classification, manipulation, storage, retrieval, movement, dissemination, and protection of [[Information|information]]. Practitioners within and outside the field engage in the study of knowledge application and usage in [[Organization|organizations]]. Additionally, they examine the interaction between people, organizations, and any existing information systems. The objective of this study is to create, replace, improve, or understand the information systems.",
