		summary = "**Mineralogy** is a subject of [[Geology|geology]] specializing in the scientific study of the [[Chemistry|chemistry]], [[Crystal structure|crystal structure]], and physical (including optical) properties of [[Mineral|minerals]] and mineralized [[Artifact (archaeology)|artifacts]]. Specific studies within mineralogy include the processes of mineral origin and formation, classification of minerals, their geographical distribution, and their utilization.",
