		tags = { "More articles" },
		summary = "**Rocket propellant** is used as a reaction mass ejected from a [[Rocket engine|rocket engine]] to produce [[Thrust|thrust]]. The energy required can either come from the propellants themselves, as with a chemical rocket, or from an external source, as with ion engines.",
