		tags = { "Chemical compounds", "Salts" },
		summary = "Salts, acid derivatives, and peroxides of sulfate are widely used in industry. Sulfates occur widely in everyday life. Sulfates are [[Salt (chemistry)|salts]] of [[Sulfuric acid|sulfuric acid]] and many are prepared from that acid.",
