		summary = "The **volt** (symbol: **V**), named after [[Alessandro Volta]], is the [[Unit of measurement|unit of measurement]] of [[Electric potential|electric potential]], [[Voltage|electric potential difference]] ([[Voltage|voltage]]), and [[Electromotive force|electromotive force]] in the [[International System of Units|International System of Units (SI)]].",
