		summary = "**Astrometry** is a branch of [[Astronomy|astronomy]] that involves precise measurements of the positions and movements of [[Star|stars]] and other [[Astronomical object|celestial bodies]]. It provides the [[Kinematics|kinematics]] and physical origin of the [[Solar System]] and this [[Galaxy|galaxy]], the [[Milky Way]].",
