		tags = { "Astronomical objects", "Notable nebulae" },
		summary = "The **Ring Nebula** is a [[Planetary nebula|planetary nebula]] in the northern [[Constellation|constellation]] of Lyra, about mid-way between the prominent stars Beta and Gamma Lyrae. It is also catalogued as **Messier 57**, **M57** and **NGC 6720**. The nebula was discovered by Charles Messier in 1779.",
