	{
		title = "Uranus",
		category = "Space",
		fame = 2,
		emoji = "🔵",
		source = "wikipedia",
		description = "Seventh planet from the Sun",
		tags = { "Astronomical objects", "Solar System" },
		summary = "**Uranus** is the seventh [[Planet|planet]] from the [[Sun]]. It is a gaseous [[Cyan|cyan]]-coloured ice giant. Most of the planet is made of [[Water|water]], [[Ammonia|ammonia]], and [[Methane|methane]] in a supercritical phase of matter, which astronomy calls \"ice\" or [[Volatile (astrogeology)|volatiles]]. The planet's atmosphere has a complex layered [[Cloud|cloud]] structure and has the lowest minimum temperature (49 K) of all the [[Solar System]]'s planets. It has a marked [[Axial tilt|axial tilt]] of 82.23° with a retrograde rotation period of 17 hours and 14 minutes. This means that in an 84-Earth-year [[Orbital period|orbital period]] around the Sun, its poles get around 42 years of continuous sunlight, followed by 42 years of continuous darkness.",
		sections = {
			{
				"Overview",
				"Uranus has the third-largest diameter and fourth-largest mass among the Solar System's planets. Based on current models, inside its volatile [[Mantle (geology)|mantle]] layer is a rocky core, and a thick [[Hydrogen|hydrogen]] and [[Helium|helium]] atmosphere surrounds it. Trace amounts of [[Hydrocarbon|hydrocarbons]] (thought to be produced via hydrolysis) and [[Carbon monoxide|carbon monoxide]] along with carbon dioxide (thought to have originated from [[Comet|comets]]) have been detected in the upper atmosphere. There are many unexplained climate phenomena in Uranus's atmosphere, such as its peak wind speed of 900 km/h, variations in its polar cap, and its erratic cloud formation. The planet also has very low internal heat compared to other giant planets, the cause of which remains unclear. Like the other giant planets, Uranus has a ring system, a [[Magnetosphere|magnetosphere]], and many [[Natural satellite|natural satellites]]. The extremely dark ring system reflects only about 2% of the incoming light.",
			},
		},
		infobox = {
			{ "Type", "ice giant" },
