		fame = 3,
		emoji = "🎮",
		source = "wikipedia",
		description = "Throwing game",
		tags = { "Sports", "Other individual sports" },
		summary = "**Darts** is a competitive sport in which two or more players bare-handedly throw small sharp-pointed projectiles known as darts at a round target known as a dartboard.",
		sections = {
			{
				"Overview",
				'Points can be scored by hitting specific marked areas of the board, though unlike in sports such as [[Archery|archery]], these areas are distributed all across the board and do not follow a principle of points increasing toward the board\'s bullseye. Though a number of similar games using various boards and rules exist, the term "darts" usually now refers to a standardised game involving a specific board design and set of rules. Darts is both a professional throwing sport and a traditional pub game. Darts is commonly played in the [[British Isles]], and recreationally loved around the world.',
