		summary = "**Diving** is the [[Sport|sport]] of jumping or falling into water from a platform or springboard, usually while performing [[Acrobatics|acrobatics]]. Diving is an internationally recognised sport that is part of the [[Olympic Games]]. In addition, unstructured and non-competitive diving is a recreational pastime.",
