		summary = "A **ferry** is a [[Ship|boat]] or [[Ship|ship]] that transports passengers, and occasionally vehicles and cargo, across a body of water. A small passenger ferry with multiple stops, like those in [[Venice]], [[Italy]], is sometimes referred to as a water taxi or water bus.",
		sections = {
