		tags = { "Transportation", "Basics" },
		aliases = { "Freight forwarding" },
		summary = '**Freight transport**, also referred to as **freight forwarding**, is the physical process of [[Transport|transporting]] commercial [[Product (business)|products]] and merchandise goods and [[Cargo|cargo]]. The term **shipping** originally referred to [[Transport|transport]] by sea but in [[American English]], it has been extended to refer to transport by land or air (International English: "carriage") as well. "[[Logistics]]", a term borrowed from the military environment, is also used in the same sense.',
	},
	{
