		summary = "**Land transport** is the [[Transport|transport]] or purposeful movement of people, animals and/or goods from one location to another via [[Land|land]]-based routes. This is in contrast with other main types of transport such as [[Maritime transport|maritime transport]], which moves over waterbodies; and [[Aviation|aviation]], which moves via [[Flight|flight]] through the [[Atmosphere|atmosphere]]. The two main forms of land transport are [[Rail transport|rail transport]] and [[Road transport|road transport]].",
	},
	{
		title = "Lock (water navigation)",
		category = "Vehicle",
		fame = 3,
		emoji = "🧭",
