		summary = "**Travel** is the [[Motion|movement]] of [[Human|people]] between distant geographical locations. Travel can be done by foot, [[Bicycle|bicycle]], [[Car|automobile]], [[Train|train]], [[Ship|boat]], [[Bus|bus]], [[Airplane|airplane]], [[Ship|ship]] or other means; with or without luggage; and can be one way or round trip. Travel can also include relatively short stays between successive movements, as in the case of [[Tourism|tourism]].",
